{'symbol': 'STX', 'date': '2023-05-23 07:31:00', 'title': 'SEAGATE ANNOUNCES OFFERING OF SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES', 'text': 'FREMONT, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--SEAGATE HDD CAYMAN (THE “COMPANY”), A SUBSIDIARY OF SEAGATE TECHNOLOGY HOLDINGS PLC (NASDAQ: STX) (“SEAGATE”), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT INTENDS, SUBJECT TO MARKET AND OTHER CONDITIONS, TO OFFER UP TO A COMBINED $1 BILLION IN AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF SENIOR NOTES DUE 2029 (THE “2029 NOTES”) AND SENIOR NOTES DUE 2031 (THE “2031 NOTES” AND, TOGETHER WITH THE 2029 NOTES, THE “NOTES”) IN A PRIVATE PLACEMENT TO PERSONS REASONABLY BELIEVED TO BE QUALIFIED INSTITUT.'}